      <section id="information">
        <p>This two-day conference will bring together colleagues, collaborators, and former students to celebrate Tom Marley and his contributions to mathematics and the community at the University of Nebraska–Lincoln.</p>
        <p>The program will feature eight invited speakers, with time for questions, informal discussion, and reconnecting with friends. Additional registration and program details will be posted as they are confirmed.</p>
      </section>

